From: StellarSeal <emnoigi1452@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:34:17 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 086/174] Asynchronous player data saving with read-after-write
 barrier

- Port asynchronous player data saving from Leaf
- Offload gzip compression and file I/O from main tick thread
- Guard rejoin and offline lookups with read-after-write barrier
- Use atomic file replacement for crash resilience
- Flush pending writes upon player disconnect and server shutdown
- Gate behind async-playerdata-saving toml toggle disabled by default

